##
 * compiler/src/entry.vri — Vir Compiler Standalone Root Entry
 * ==========================================================
 * Canonical entry point for compiling the self-hosting Vir compiler directly
 * from modular sources without Python bundle synchronization.
 *
 * Pipeline
 *   source.vri → lex → parse → lower → regalloc → codegen → Mach-O/ELF
 *
 * Usage
 *   ./virc compiler/src/entry.vri -o bin/virc
 ##

module vir.compiler.virc

